  "_comment": "Pre-DLC ids, first frozen at world_version 0.3.4. RE-PINNED 2026-09-23: four base parts that the game reports solved the moment the level opens were removed as locations (Bathroom Drawer (Drawer Chores) - Drawer, Medicine Cabinet - Jar Lid, Paper Plane Supplies (Drawer Chores) - Drawer, Tool Drawer (Drawer Chores) - Drawer), which shifted every base id after them. droha: 'i do not care about seed ids moving ever'. RE-PINNED AGAIN 2026-09-24: droha played Workbench and 'Draggables For Targets' never fired, so that part became notALocation; Workbench is then a single-part level, whose part check is its Solution check, so 'Workbench - Tools' went too, and every base id after them moved down by 2. Re-pin only for a deliberate change like that one, and say why here; an unexplained diff in this test is still a bug. RE-PINNED A THIRD TIME 2026-09-24: droha could not peel Fruit Stickers holding only Tidying, so Remove Stickers depends on Match Stickers as well; the mutual pair is one group, the level is single-part, and 'Fruit Stickers - Match Stickers' and 'Fruit Stickers - Remove Stickers' went, moving every base id after them down by 2. RE-PINNED A FOURTH TIME 2026-09-28, fixed endings (droha: 'yes we want fixed ending names'): every solution location is named for its ending ('Spoons - Solution: Stacked'; a single ending is just '- Solution'; a generated puzzle stays numbered), a part that is an ending of its own went (droha: 'No reason to give an ending 2 locations'), and Medicine Cabinet's and Mirror's parts were merged (per colour; the still life). Every base id moved. RE-PINNED A FIFTH TIME 2026-09-28: generated puzzles have fixed endings too (droha: 'don't generated puzzles still have fixed solutions?'; their ids are the same on every seed, by position), so 'Stamps (Randomized) - Solution 1' is 'Stamps (Randomized) - Solution' and 'Pencils (Randomized) - Solution 2' is '- Solution: Ordered 2'; and Mirror is two parts, the big items in place ('Still Life') and the little things ('Little Things'), as droha split it. Every base id after Mirror moved down by 2. RE-PINNED A SIXTH TIME 2026-09-28: Mirror's little things are part of its Solution, not a check (droha: 'for mirror just fold the little things into the solution'), so 'Mirror - Little Things' went and every base id after it moved down by 1. RE-PINNED A SEVENTH TIME 2026-09-28: Books (Randomized)'s second ending answers to Shuffle_1 or Draggables_0 - a symmetric seed checks its second solution with a Draggables controller (gensweep:40:995) - so it keeps the fixed names '- Solution: Shuffle 1' and '- Solution: Shuffle 2'; no id moved. RE-PINNED AN EIGHTH TIME 2026-09-28: droha played every ending nobody had seen, so Storage Boxes, Candles and Buttons name their second ending ('- Solution: Sorting Items 2', '- Solution: Candles Object 2') instead of '- Solution: Other 1'; no id moved. RE-PINNED A NINTH TIME 2026-09-28: Breadtags is just its Solution (droha: 'just have the solution'), so its Crumbs and Interlocking part checks went on all eight copies (16 names) and every base id after them moved down. RE-PINNED A TENTH TIME 2026-09-30: droha played Bowls both ways and each part fired with its own ending (Pattern with Match-(Draggables)_0, Crack with _1), so 'Bowls - Crack' and 'Bowls - Pattern' are part of the Solution (solutionOnlyParts) and every base id after them moved down by 2.",
